}

docs {
  # List Chat Models

  Get available chat/text generation models.

  ## Endpoint
  `GET /v1/chat/models`

  ## Response

  ```json
  {
    "object": "list",
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "gpt-4o",
        "object": "model",
        "created": 1704067200,
        "owned_by": "openai",
        "description": "GPT-4o - Latest multimodal model"
      },
      {
        "id": "claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022",
        "object": "model",
        "owned_by": "anthropic",
        "description": "Claude 3.5 Sonnet - Best balance"
      },
      {
        "id": "gemini-2.0-flash",
        "object": "model",
        "owned_by": "google",
        "description": "Gemini 2.0 Flash"
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
}
